# A combined example of vehicles, character controllers, canvas and scene assets.
# Press Play: keys 1-4 select a vehicle, 5-6 select a character, and 7 restores the overview.
# WASD moves, Space brakes or jumps, Shift applies the handbrake, and arrow keys orbit.
# Assets/Scripts/CSharp/SandboxDemo.cs resolves named actors and updates the controls canvas.
# StreamedModelComponent resumes model expansion; imported meshes keep their authored materials.

